    'If the desired functionality of the application means that this behavior is unavoidable, then defenses must be implemented within the client-side code. In many cases, the relevant data can be validated on a whitelist basis, only allowing content that is known to be safe. In other cases, it will be necessary to sanitize or encode the data. This can be a complex task, and depending on the context into which the data is to be inserted, may involve a combination of JavaScript escaping, HTML encoding, and URL encoding, in the appropriate sequence.' => 'Jika kebutuhan fitur aplikasi membuat pola tersebut sulit dihindari, pertahanan harus dipasang pada kode sisi klien. Dalam banyak kasus, data dapat divalidasi berbasis whitelist untuk hanya mengizinkan konten yang pasti aman. Di kasus lain, data perlu disanitasi atau di-encode. Proses ini cukup kompleks dan, bergantung konteks sisipannya, dapat memerlukan kombinasi escaping JavaScript, HTML encoding, dan URL encoding dalam urutan yang tepat.',
    'For measures you can take to prevent specific vulnerabilities, please refer to the corresponding vulnerability pages linked from the table above.' => 'Untuk langkah pencegahan tiap kerentanan secara spesifik, rujuk halaman kerentanan terkait dari tabel di atas.',
