    'To exploit this vulnerable code, you could inject the following HTML to clobber the [[C0]] reference with an anchor element:' => 'Untuk mengeksploitasi kode rentan ini, Anda dapat menyuntikkan HTML berikut agar referensi [[C0]] tertimpa oleh elemen anchor:',
    'As the two anchors use the same ID, the DOM groups them together in a DOM collection. The DOM clobbering vector then overwrites the [[C0]] reference with this DOM collection. A [[C1]] attribute is used on the last anchor element in order to clobber the [[C2]] property of the [[C3]] object, which points to an external script.' => 'Karena kedua anchor memakai ID yang sama, DOM mengelompokkannya dalam satu koleksi DOM. Vektor DOM clobbering tersebut lalu menimpa referensi [[C0]] dengan koleksi DOM ini. Atribut [[C1]] pada anchor terakhir dipakai untuk menimpa properti [[C2]] milik objek [[C3]] yang mengarah ke skrip eksternal.',
    'Another common technique is to use a [[C0]] element along with an element such as [[C1]] to clobber DOM properties. For example, clobbering the [[C2]] property enables you to bypass client-side filters that use it in their logic. Although the filter will enumerate the [[C3]] property, it will not actually remove any attributes because the property has been clobbered with a DOM node. As a result, you will be able to inject malicious attributes that would normally be filtered out. For example, consider the following injection:' => 'Teknik umum lainnya menggunakan elemen [[C0]] bersama elemen seperti [[C1]] untuk menimpa properti DOM. Misalnya, menimpa properti [[C2]] memungkinkan Anda melewati filter sisi klien yang mengandalkan properti tersebut dalam logikanya. Meski filter mengiterasi properti [[C3]], filter tidak menghapus atribut apa pun karena propertinya sudah tertimpa node DOM. Alhasil, Anda dapat menyuntikkan atribut berbahaya yang normalnya disaring. Contoh injeksinya:',
    'In this case, the client-side filter would traverse the DOM and encounter a whitelisted [[C0]] element. Normally, the filter would loop through the [[C1]] property of the [[C2]] element and remove any blacklisted attributes. However, because the [[C3]] property has been clobbered with the [[C4]] element, the filter loops through the [[C5]] element instead. As the [[C6]] element has an undefined length, the conditions for the [[C7]] loop of the filter (for example [[C8]]) are not met, and the filter simply moves on to the next element instead. This results in the [[C9]] event being ignored altogether by the filter, which subsequently allows the [[C10]] function to be called in the browser.' => 'Pada kasus ini, filter sisi klien menelusuri DOM dan menemui elemen [[C0]] yang diizinkan. Normalnya filter akan mengulang properti [[C1]] milik elemen [[C2]] dan menghapus atribut terlarang. Namun karena properti [[C3]] tertimpa elemen [[C4]], filter justru mengiterasi elemen [[C5]]. Karena panjang elemen [[C6]] tidak terdefinisi, kondisi perulangan [[C7]] pada filter (misalnya [[C8]]) tidak terpenuhi sehingga filter langsung lanjut ke elemen berikutnya. Akibatnya event [[C9]] terlewat sepenuhnya dan fungsi [[C10]] dapat dipanggil di browser.',
    'How to prevent DOM-clobbering attacks' => 'Cara mencegah serangan DOM clobbering',
    'In the simplest terms, you can prevent DOM-clobbering attacks by implementing checks to make sure that objects or functions are what you expect them to be. For instance, you can check that the attributes property of a DOM node is actually an instance of [[C0]]. This ensures that the property is an attributes property and not a clobbered HTML element.' => 'Secara sederhana, serangan DOM clobbering dapat dicegah dengan memeriksa bahwa objek atau fungsi benar-benar bertipe sesuai ekspektasi. Misalnya, pastikan properti attributes pada node DOM merupakan instance dari [[C0]] sehingga dijamin properti atribut asli, bukan elemen HTML hasil clobbering.',
    'You should also avoid writing code that references a global variable in conjunction with the logical OR operator [[C0]], as this can lead to DOM clobbering vulnerabilities.' => 'Hindari pula kode yang mereferensikan variabel global bersama operator logika OR [[C0]], karena pola ini rentan terhadap DOM clobbering.',
    'In summary:' => 'Ringkasnya:',
    'Check that objects and functions are legitimate. If you are filtering the DOM, make sure you check that the object or function is not a DOM node.' => 'Periksa apakah objek dan fungsi memang sah. Saat memfilter DOM, pastikan objek atau fungsi tersebut bukan node DOM.',
